  "acceptedInvariants": [
    "Exact media.upload permission and actual media.register schema; two stable separate mutation keys, no invented attach command or expected_version.",
    "Full current authority/session/origin generation checked before each typed mutation and after async response; local encrypted nativeMedia marker never enters API body.",
    "Marked pending command requires matching encrypted descriptor and exact key/input/body/full authority; missing descriptor and authority drift fail closed; generic fresh-key registration for linked upload is denied.",
    "Known upload/registration ACK survives local persistence/cleanup failure; REGISTERED recovery only performs fresh reads and local cleanup, not POST; subsequent gallery read failure is independent.",
    "Separate device-bound Keychain namespace and authenticated encrypted metadata; no bytes/URL/cookie persisted; missing key/file and malformed state fail closed; immutable receipt/version/CAS checks.",
    "Dedicated fixed-origin percent-encoded client-copy download, no redirects/shared cookie store/cache, bounded25MiB streamed body; generic2MiB response/64KiB command limits retained.",
    "Presentation-specific picker/export ticket/request identifiers; cancelled owned tasks and late callback fences; synchronous FileDocument fence checks before exposing bytes."
